Under a Condition an undefined property glued to literal text (eng/$(ProjectType).targets) is any value: every matching file is imported, so a change to one of them selects the importer.
-- base/Directory.Build.targets --
<Project><Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)eng/$(ProjectType).targets" Condition="$(ProjectType) != ''" /></Project>
-- base/eng/Library.targets --
<Project />
-- base/eng/Test.targets --
<Project />
-- base/src/App/App.csproj --
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup><TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework></PropertyGroup>
</Project>
-- base/src/App/a.cs --
class A {}
-- head/eng/Test.targets --
<Project><PropertyGroup><X>1</X></PropertyGroup></Project>
-- want --
notfull
select dotnet:src/App/App.csproj
nowiden unknown_import
